{"id":"status","lemma":"статус","pos":"noun","rank":1177,"glosses":["status"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f5/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%83%D1%81.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%83%D1%81.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"статуса","plural":"статусы"},"examples":[{"text":"Каков наш статус?","en":"What's our status?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"our, ours"},null]},{"text":"Я хочу проверить статус моего заказа.","en":"I want to check the status of my order.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to examine"},null,{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"order","l":"заказ"}]},{"text":"Дорогой автомобиль — это символ статуса.","en":"An expensive car is a status symbol.","words":[{"g":"dear, precious"},{"g":"car"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"symbol"},null]},{"text":"Давайте сохраним статус-кво.","en":"Let's maintain the status quo.","words":[{"g":"to let"},{"g":"to save","l":"сохранить"},null,null]},{"text":"Несмотря на плохие продажи, альбом обрёл культовый статус и благосклонность критиков.","en":"Although the album sold poorly, it gained a cult following and attracted critics.","words":[null,null,{"g":"bad","l":"плохой"},{"g":"sale, selling","l":"продажа"},{"g":"album"},{"g":"to gain","l":"обрести"},null,null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"benevolence"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"in spite of, despite"]]}]}